s/singer Jennifer Hudson's nephew Julian King featured; scenes shown of the vehicle; details given about the murder of Jennifer's mother Darnell Donerson and brother Jason Hudson and of the arrest of sister Julia Hudson's estranged husband William Balfour.  [Chicago police department superintendent Jody WEIS&#134;- confirms the body was Julian's.]  [Earlier, mother Julia HUDSON&nbsp- pleads for Julian.]  Jennifer's current career reviewed.  [WBBM-TV entertainment reporter Bill ZWECKER&#134;- cites the importance of faith in Jennifer's life.]  The frightening homicide statistics in Chicago cited.  [Hudson family neighbor Angela RUSSELL&#134;- comments.] ", "segment_duration": 130, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "64280.0", "legacy_segment_id": 909720, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "PFqzIK2mK7", "broadcast_date": "2008-10-27", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1730, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 909707, "segment_id": "mhWhE0ulU6", "segment_broadcast_id": "PFqzIK2mK7", "segment_title": "Child Prostitution", "segment_description": "(Studio: Katie Couric)  An FBI crackdown across the country against child prostitution rings reported. ", "segment_duration": 20, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "64410.0", "legacy_segment_id": 909721, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "PFqzIK2mK7", "broadcast_date": "2008-10-27", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Eveni